{"ids":{"anilist":181970,"mal":56609},"titles":{"romaji":"Kizumonogatari: Koyomi Vamp","english":"KIZUMONOGATARI -Koyomi Vamp-","native":"傷物語 -こよみヴァンプ-"},"format":"MOVIE","status":"FINISHED","season":"WINTER","season_year":2024,"episodes":1,"duration":144,"description":"Compilation film of the three <i>Kizumonogatari</i> movies.<br><br>\n\nSpring break, an interval of time between the second and third year of high school. It was one fateful evening when Koyomi Araragi encounters her.<br><br>\n\nKiss-shot Acerola-orion Heart-under-blade.<br>\nLegendary Vampire. Killer of Apparitions. King of Apparitions.<br><br>\n\nHer legs and arms were cruelly torn apart, her extravagant dress soaked in red; she's a monster who finds herself in a tragic state, laying in a pool of her own blood. However, Koyomi finds her to be beautiful this way. <br><br>\n\nOn the brink of death after losing her four limbs, she asks Koyomi to save her. After experiencing fear, chaos, and finally conflict, Koyomi gives his own blood in order to save her.\nBut when he awakens, he finds himself re-born as her vampire kin.<br><br>\n\nKoyomi wishes to revert to being a human from a vampire. However, he must take back all of Kiss-shot's limbs to do so. Working as a negotiator, Meme Oshino stands in middle ground as Koyomi attempts to recapture her four limbs by challenging three powerful vampire hunters.<br><br>\n\nThis hellish spring break, the final one of his high school life, is only just beginning.<br><br>\n\n(Source: KIZUMONOGATARI -Koyomi Vamp- Official USA Website, edited)","genres":["Action","Drama","Horror","Mystery","Supernatural"],"score_anilist":80,"popularity":6367,"images":{"poster":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx181970-dqNqPsJcBk5I.jpg","poster_color":null,"banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/181970-T02XjDjycYZb.jpg"},"anilist":{"id":181970,"idMal":56609,"title":{"romaji":"Kizumonogatari: Koyomi Vamp","english":"KIZUMONOGATA